      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَجِيجٌ</span></b>  (S, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِهْجِيجٌ</span></b>  (K) <i>A deep valley:</i>
